{"body": [{"y0": 67.2, "x0": 58.5, "x1": 171.9, "text": "GRAMMATICA LATINA"}, {"y0": 80.9, "x0": 58.5, "x1": 103.3, "text": "Gerundium"}, {"y0": 95.0, "x0": 68.7, "x1": 313.0, "text": "Horà in nàrrando cónsümpta, Syra plüs temporis ad nàr-"}, {"y0": 108.8, "x0": 58.5, "x1": 237.7, "text": "randum nón habet et finem facit nàrrandi."}, {"y0": 122.0, "x0": 38.8, "x1": 312.8, "text": "150 — 'Nàrrandum' est gerundium; quod ponitur in loco infini-"}, {"y0": 136.9, "x0": 58.3, "x1": 312.8, "text": "tivi et sic declinàtur: accüsativus -ndum, genetivus -ndi, ablà-"}, {"y0": 150.8, "x0": 58.3, "x1": 152.8, "text": "tivus (et dativus) -ndo."}, {"y0": 164.8, "x0": 68.5, "x1": 107.6, "text": "Exempla:"}, {"y0": 178.3, "x0": 68.4, "x1": 313.2, "text": "Ovidius, semper paratus ad amandum, librum dé amando"}, {"y0": 192.3, "x0": 37.9, "x1": 214.7, "text": "155 scripsit, qui appellatur *Ars amandi."}, {"y0": 206.6, "x0": 68.0, "x1": 311.9, "text": "Magister, qui artem docendi scit, paratus est ad docendum."}, {"y0": 220.4, "x0": 57.9, "x1": 201.2, "text": "Magister ipse discit alios docendo."}, {"y0": 234.5, "x0": 68.2, "x1": 313.5, "text": "Industrii estote in scribendo, discipuli! Tempus scribendi:"}, {"y0": 248.3, "x0": 57.9, "x1": 200.7, "text": "est. Estisne paràti ad scribendum?"}, {"y0": 261.1, "x0": 37.4, "x1": 312.6, "text": "160 — Iam tempus dormiendi est, sed Quintus nón est fessus"}, {"y0": 275.9, "x0": 57.9, "x1": 227.3, "text": "audiendó neque parátus ad dormiendum."}, {"y0": 289.7, "x0": 68.4, "x1": 241.2, "text": "Scribere scribendo, dicendo dicere discés."}, {"y0": 312.8, "x0": 58.6, "x1": 111.7, "text": "PENSVM AÀ"}, {"y0": 326.6, "x0": 58.3, "x1": 313.0, "text": "Naves necessáriae sunt ad nàvig-. Iülia delectatur in horto"}, {"y0": 340.3, "x0": 58.5, "x1": 312.8, "text": "ambul- et florés carp-. Medus consilium fugi- excógitàvit;"}, {"y0": 354.2, "x0": 58.6, "x1": 299.7, "text": "Lydia eum iüvit in fugi-. Paulum satis est ad beàté viv-."}, {"y0": 368.4, "x0": 68.2, "x1": 313.0, "text": "Verba: iungere —isse —um; figere —isse Cum; mergere —isse"}, {"y0": 382.4, "x0": 57.9, "x1": 312.6, "text": "—um; ürere —isse Cum; movére -isse -um; capere -isse -um;"}, {"y0": 394.3, "x0": 58.6, "x1": 318.2, "text": "invenire —isse —um; considere -isse; iuváre —isse; accidere -"}, {"y0": 410.3, "x0": 58.5, "x1": 81.9, "text": "—Isse."}, {"y0": 431.2, "x0": 58.1, "x1": 110.5, "text": "PENSVM B"}, {"y0": 444.7, "x0": 58.1, "x1": 312.6, "text": "Daedalus exitum labyrinthi — [- reperire] nón poterat nec"}, {"y0": 458.4, "x0": 57.6, "x1": 312.6, "text": "— [2 üllus homó] eum in fugiendó — poterat. — igitur aliae"}, {"y0": 472.6, "x0": 57.9, "x1": 313.0, "text": "viae clausae erant, vir — [2 audéns] per àera — constituit. —"}, {"y0": 486.3, "x0": 58.1, "x1": 313.2, "text": "pauis filium délectávit. Tum Daedalus àlàs confecit ex —"}, {"y0": 500.0, "x0": 58.1, "x1": 312.3, "text": "quàs cérà iünxit et in lacertis —. Postquam hoc — perfecit,"}, {"y0": 513.8, "x0": 58.3, "x1": 312.6, "text": "Daedalus filium suum — volandi docuit: *— mé! Move àlàs"}, {"y0": 527.7, "x0": 57.6, "x1": 312.6, "text": "— — hóc modó! Ars volandi — [- nón] difficilis est. Sed"}, {"y0": 542.3, "x0": 58.1, "x1": 312.6, "text": "antequam hinc —, hoc té moneó: noli volare in — àere prope"}], "margin": [{"y0": 94.4, "x0": 326.1, "x1": 363.5, "text": "nàrrandum"}, {"y0": 103.6, "x0": 326.1, "x1": 356.2, "text": "nàrrandi"}, {"y0": 112.6, "x0": 326.1, "x1": 357.1, "text": "nárrazdó"}, {"y0": 126.1, "x0": 325.9, "x1": 379.9, "text": "-ndum -ndi -ndó"}, {"y0": 140.3, "x0": 326.5, "x1": 361.7, "text": "[1] amà|re"}, {"y0": 150.4, "x0": 325.9, "x1": 363.9, "text": "ama|nd|um"}, {"y0": 159.4, "x0": 325.9, "x1": 356.7, "text": "ama|nd|t"}, {"y0": 168.4, "x0": 325.9, "x1": 357.6, "text": "ama|nd|ó"}, {"y0": 176.7, "x0": 326.5, "x1": 363.5, "text": "[2] docé|re"}, {"y0": 186.4, "x0": 325.7, "x1": 365.7, "text": "doce|nd|um"}, {"y0": 185.7, "x0": 325.6, "x1": 358.1, "text": "debi"}, {"y0": 204.8, "x0": 325.6, "x1": 359.2, "text": "doce|nd|ó"}, {"y0": 213.2, "x0": 326.1, "x1": 367.9, "text": "[3) scrib|ere"}, {"y0": 223.1, "x0": 325.6, "x1": 369.7, "text": "scrib|end|um"}, {"y0": 222.2, "x0": 325.6, "x1": 362.1, "text": "n i"}, {"y0": 241.3, "x0": 325.6, "x1": 363.2, "text": "scrib|end|o"}, {"y0": 249.6, "x0": 325.9, "x1": 368.2, "text": "[4] dormi|re"}, {"y0": 259.3, "x0": 325.4, "x1": 373.6, "text": "dormil|end|um"}, {"y0": 268.3, "x0": 325.4, "x1": 366.2, "text": "dormi|end|i"}, {"y0": 277.3, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 367.1, "text": "dormi|end|ó"}, {"y0": 291.3, "x0": 325.4, "x1": 376.1, "text": "dicere — loqui"}, {"y0": 332.4, "x0": 325.7, "x1": 377.0, "text": "Vocàbula nova:"}, {"y0": 341.2, "x0": 325.2, "x1": 340.5, "text": "fuga"}, {"y0": 350.4, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 359.8, "text": "consilium"}, {"y0": 361.5, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 346.6, "text": "carcer"}, {"y0": 368.7, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 342.8, "text": "orbis"}, {"y0": 378.5, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 347.7, "text": "nátüra"}, {"y0": 388.9, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 335.1, "text": "ars"}, {"y0": 398.1, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 341.6, "text": "opus"}, {"y0": 406.9, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 346.3, "text": "penna"}, {"y0": 414.1, "x0": 324.8, "x1": 341.6, "text": "ignis"}, {"y0": 423.1, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 352.2, "text": "lacertus"}, {"y0": 432.1, "x0": 324.8, "x1": 350.6, "text": "Itbertàs"}, {"y0": 441.5, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 359.9, "text": "multitüdó"}, {"y0": 450.6, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 362.6, "text": "paeninsula"}, {"y0": 460.5, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 343.4, "text": "casus"}, {"y0": 468.8, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 341.4, "text": "celer"}, {"y0": 478.0, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 353.5, "text": "reliquus"}, {"y0": 487.0, "x0": 324.5, "x1": 345.5, "text": "audax"}, {"y0": 495.8, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 340.9, "text": "liber"}, {"y0": 504.8, "x0": 324.5, "x1": 357.4, "text": "studiosus"}, {"y0": 514.0, "x0": 324.3, "x1": 347.2, "text": "ingens"}, {"y0": 523.0, "x0": 324.1, "x1": 351.3, "text": "infimus"}, {"y0": 534.5, "x0": 324.5, "x1": 354.2, "text": "summus"